Subject: [PATCH 4/5] cuda : add HIP and MUSA fallbacks for byte permutation in
 TQ1_0

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/common.cuh  | 12 ++++++------
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vecdotq.cuh | 14 ++++++++++++++
